# 🌾 Fallah Application - Agricultural Store Management System

[![Kotlin](https://img.shields.io/badge/Kotlin-2.0.0-blue.svg)](https://kotlinlang.org)
[![Jetpack Compose](https://img.shields.io/badge/Jetpack%20Compose-1.6.0-green.svg)](https://developer.android.com/jetpack/compose)
[![Room](https://img.shields.io/badge/Room-2.6.0-orange.svg)](https://developer.android.com/training/data-storage/room)
[![Hilt](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hilt-2.48-purple.svg)](https://dagger.dev/hilt/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](LICENSE)
[![API](https://img.shields.io/badge/API-24%2B-brightgreen.svg)](https://android-arsenal.com/api?level=24)

## 📱 Overview

**Fallah Application** is a comprehensive agricultural store management system designed to help farmers and agricultural businesses manage their operations efficiently. The app provides complete solutions for inventory management, sales tracking, debt management, customer relations, and business analytics.

## ✨ Features

### 🛍️ **Store Management**
- Add, edit, and delete products with images
- Real-time inventory tracking
- Low stock alerts and notifications
- Product categories and filtering
- Barcode scanning support

### 🛒 **Shopping Cart System**
- Add/remove items to cart
- Automatic tax calculation
- Quantity management
- Discount application
- Invoice generation

### 💰 **Sales & Financial Management**
- Daily, weekly, and monthly sales reports
- Revenue and profit tracking
- Sales history and statistics
- Tax reporting
- Expense tracking

### 📊 **Debt Management**
- Customer credit tracking
- Payment scheduling
- Debt collection reminders
- Payment history
- Outstanding balance reports

### 👥 **Customer Management**
- Customer profiles and history
- Purchase history tracking
- Customer segmentation
- Loyalty program integration
- Communication logs

### 📈 **Analytics & Reports**
- Interactive dashboards
- Sales trends and patterns
- Top-selling products
- Seasonal analysis
- Export reports (PDF/Excel)

### 🌍 **Multi-Language Support**
- Arabic (Right-to-Left support)
- English
- Easy language switching
- Localized content

### 🎨 **User Experience**
- Modern Material Design 3
- Dark/Light theme support
- Smooth animations
- Responsive layouts
- Offline-first architecture

### 🔔 **Smart Notifications**
- Low inventory alerts
- Debt payment reminders
- Daily sales summaries
- Product expiry warnings

## 🛠️ **Technical Architecture**

### Technology Stack

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|------------|---------|---------|
| **Kotlin** | 2.0.0 | Primary programming language |
| **Jetpack Compose** | 1.6.0 | Modern UI toolkit |
| **Room Database** | 2.6.0 | Local data persistence |
| **Dagger Hilt** | 2.48 | Dependency injection |
| **Coroutines** | 1.7.3 | Asynchronous programming |
| **Flow** | 1.7.3 | Reactive streams |
| **Coil** | 2.5.0 | Image loading |
| **Material 3** | 1.2.0 | UI components |

### Architecture Pattern: **MVVM**
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ UI Layer │
│ (Jetpack Compose Screens) │
└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────┘
│
┌─────────────────▼───────────────────────────┐
│ ViewModels │
│ (State management & business logic) │
└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────┘
│
┌─────────────────▼───────────────────────────┐
│ Repository │
│ (Data operations & caching) │
└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────┘
│
┌─────────────────▼───────────────────────────┐
│ Data Sources │
│ (Room Database / Local Storage) │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘

